WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:15.400


00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:24.960
♪ Why did you invite me again? ♪

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:33.990
♪ Without good wine, the old immortal won't come ♪

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:40.640
[What If It's Funny?]

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:50.760
[The East New Town project has started!]

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:07.840
Mr. Rong.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:10.810
I've

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:12.350
brought the master here.

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:13.200
What master?

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:16.500
The one I recommended to you last time.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.120
He's an expert in geomancy.

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:20.870
Mr. Zhou.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:21.890
Today,

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:23.680
I'm here to bring you wealth.

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:26.900
To bring me wealth?

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:27.530
Exactly.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:30.480
Do you think

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:31.890
I'm short of wealth?

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.729
The wealth is not brought by me.

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:35.240
It's this.

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:38.500
I brought this specially for you.

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:42.920
This God of Wealth...

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:44.850
This God of Wealth is not ordinary.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.320
After my forty-nine...

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:54.000
[The East New Town project has started!]

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.810
[Fang Yong, Director of the Administrative Committee of the East New Town]

00:01:59.759 --> 00:02:00.760
Interesting.

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:04.790
Master, where

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:06.410
should I place this?

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:23.840
Master.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:24.990
Don't speak.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:26.800
I'm looking for the spot.

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:31.650
Usually, the God of Wealth

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:35.400
sits in the north and faces the south.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.660
This one is different.

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:38.440
Let it sit in the east.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:39.970
Just place it there.

00:02:40.579 --> 00:02:42.700
♪ Why did you invite me again? ♪

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:45.120
[East New Town]

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.040
♪ Without good wine, the old immortal won't come ♪

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:51.850
[The East New Town project has started!]

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:54.690
[Fang Yong, Director of the Administrative Committee of the East New Town]

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.480
[East New Town]

00:04:18.839 --> 00:04:22.590
[Born with Luck]

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:25.590
[Episode 4]

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:30.870
[Sanjiangkou Transportation Center]

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:44.760
Bro, who exactly are we going to target?

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.000
Bro.

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.320
That's the hardest part.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.130
Our target is a corrupt official,

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.480
and it has to be a big one.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.310
But how to determine

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.510
who the big corrupt officials is

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:00.800
is a thorny issue.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:01.870
Over the years, those who
were extremely corrupt

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:03.670
and well-known among the people

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.120
have all been arrested.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.000
The ones left are of course

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.860
extremely low-key and cautious.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.070
So who exactly is it?

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:34.450
Bro, you haven't said yet.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:36.140
How do we find this person?

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:39.040
Let's draw a profile of him.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:39.830
I'll go get a pen from the car.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:40.760
No need for a pen.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.630
Since the person
is a big corrupt official,

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:44.960
their rank can't be low.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.270
Though those clerks
sitting at the service windows

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:48.750
are so proud of themselves

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:50.040
when selecting a romantic partner

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.770
that they act highly arrogant,

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.180
they...

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.310
Secondly,

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.120
the person must have been in a position
of real power

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.320
for a number of years.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:01.270
Otherwise, even if the person
is a big corrupt official,

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:01.970
with limited time,

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:03.770
they can't embezzle much money.

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:04.770
Finally,

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:08.160
the person has to be over forty.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:09.640
Do you know why?

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:10.460
Why?

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:12.560
Because only older corrupt officials

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.560
would be foolish enough

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.560
to hide the embezzled money and things
in their homes.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:19.680
Who is it?

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:27.800
Let's go.

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:30.640
There's a man over there staring at me.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:31.720
Could he be a cop?

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.570
We can't take the coach.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:45.870
Who is it?

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:57.970
Bro.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:58.960
Who is it?

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.340
Chief, where are we going?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.200
To the train station.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:29.000
Why the train station?

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:30.890
Wouldn't they take a coach?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:32.830
I'm sure they'll go to the train station.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:33.510
Why?

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.000
It's an investigator's intuition.

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:04.860
[The East New Town project has started!]

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:06.690
[Fang Yong, Director of the Administrative Committee of the East New Town]

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.510
What did you just say?

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:09.680
"What's wrong, bro?"

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:10.910
The sentence before that.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:11.570
"Who is it?"

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.810
The East New Town project has started.

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:22.360
The director
of the administrative committee

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:23.600
is Fang Yong.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.710
Excuse me, excuse me.

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:29.510
[Police]

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:30.630
Excuse me.

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.120
Stop. Who are you?

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:33.520
Hello.

00:08:33.549 --> 00:08:34.630
W-We are police officers
from Sanjiangkou City,

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.030
members of a CID branch.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.120
You are police officers, right?

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:37.510
Yes.

00:08:37.549 --> 00:08:38.840
We have an important witness to find.

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:39.510
Please

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:40.150
register here.

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:40.480
Okay.

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:41.230
Thank you.

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:49.760
[Police]

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:56.960
Alright, you can go in.

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:57.270
Okay.

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:57.750
Chief!

00:08:59.270 --> 00:08:59.750
Chief.

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:01.540
Chief.

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:04.750
One, two, go.

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:06.610
Where, where?

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:07.610
How do we get in?

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:45.810
They are cops.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:48.510
Yes.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:49.540
Yes.

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:50.870
It's okay, it's okay.

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:01.200
Li Feng.

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:02.870
Don't do it again.

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:03.690
Jiang Ying.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:04.720
Last night,

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:05.720
you delivered the takeout to me,

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:06.240
right?

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:08.140
Yes.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:10.440
Yesterday at your house,

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:12.040
seeing your police uniform,

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:14.150
I knew you were a cop.

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:14.930
Yes, I am.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:15.490
Don't...

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.870
I told you, she delivered it.

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:18.800
We found her.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.020
Come at me.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:24.580
I killed them all.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.720
It has nothing to do with her.

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:29.900
Li Feng.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:31.550
Stop it.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:35.480
I don't want to escape anymore.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.130
Think about our child.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:03.750
It's fine.

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.080
We hid in Sanjiangkou

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:10.300
for over half a year.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:12.770
We thought we were safe.

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:16.250
But I had a bad feeling last night.

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:18.670
You were checking for drunk driving,

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.120
even on non-motorized vehicles.

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:22.180
You were looking for me, weren't you?

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:31.200
I didn't expect

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:32.430
you to find us today.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:38.440
Fine.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.000
Debts owed

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.800
must be paid sooner or later.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.100
I admit defeat.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:28.720
Ren.

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:29.800
Ren.

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:31.200
Master, what's up?

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:32.970
Well, there's no one else here.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:33.840
Nobody else is here, Ren.

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:34.440
Come here.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:37.640
Say it.

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:39.030
No, this thing,

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:41.630
Zheng Yongbing bought it
for only 60,000 yuan.

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:44.120
You said

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:46.000
it cost 160,000.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:49.670
How much?

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:50.880
160,000 yuan.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:52.640
How much should I pay you?

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:53.930
60,000 yuan.

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:55.390
Then you quoted Mr. Zhou

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:57.480
260,000 for it.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:01.290
What do you mean?

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:03.000
I was wondering

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.800
if you could pay me a little more.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:08.840
You are just an extra.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:10.510
80 yuan per day.

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:12.680
How much did I pay you?

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:13.690
1,000 yuan.

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:19.370
Where's your conscience?

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:20.870
Don't be too greedy.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.000
How about your professional ethics?

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.390
Well, what conscience?

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:25.000
Ren.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.630
I nailed it in one take just now.

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:28.960
My professional skills are exceptional.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.850
I will give you another 500.

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:33.080
Get out of here.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:33.680
Okay.

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:34.820
Thank you, Ren.

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:39.340
Li Penggai.

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:40.320
Come here.

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:42.550
Brother Ren, I was looking for you.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.120
Do you have 500 yuan?

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.440
[Li Penggai, Head of the Security Team of Rongcheng Group]

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:46.240
Just 500.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:52.530
Almost enough.

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:56.440
That's all.

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:57.670
One more word,

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:00.130
and you'll prepare for your own funeral.

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:01.080
Let's go.

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:05.440
Speak.

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:07.610
Ye Jian is dead.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.040
Dead?

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:14.670
How did he die?

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:26.490
Who killed him?

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:30.230
Ren,

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.990
what I got earlier is about enough.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:33.050
I will leave first.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:48.000
[Fang Yong]

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:55.200
Mr. Rong.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:55.780
Jianren.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.400
Come and look.

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:00.080
Look.

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:02.450
Does Fang Yong

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:04.750
look like this God of Wealth?

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:06.440
He does.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:07.560
Look carefully.

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:09.280
So lifelike.

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:12.320
Mr. Rong.

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:14.390
Come out with me.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:15.990
I need to tell you something.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:17.320
Just say it here.

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:18.800
Let's talk outside.

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:31.950
Hurry up.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:32.870
Hurry.

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:35.410
Wait, what are you doing?

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:37.660
Is the sky falling?

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.280
Mr. Rong.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:46.120
Please

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:49.970
take your medicine first.

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:05.180
Without water?

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:24.310
Say it.

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:28.890
My condolences.

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:34.380
My third uncle died, right?

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:37.160
No?

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:38.670
Well, who died?

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:39.870
It's not a big deal. Why...

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:41.480
Why did you give me this medicine?

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.410
There's no need.

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:43.640
Who? Tell me.

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.190
Y-Ye Jian.

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:48.780
Captain Ye is dead.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:51.590
Dead?

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:52.720
Yes.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.120
Ye Jian...

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:56.960
He's dead.

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:07.530
Nonsense.

00:17:08.069 --> 00:17:09.200
That's impossible.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.720
I didn't believe it at first either.

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:13.880
I just went to confirm it.

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:14.750
Last night,

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:15.960
he was killed.

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:23.200
S-Say it again.

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.180
He was killed last night.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:26.960
Think about who he was.

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:28.420
Who would dare to hurt him?

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:30.930
The police are investigating.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:37.610
Do you know who did it?

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:40.610
Do you?

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:41.640
We will find out.

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:42.570
We will find out.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:44.020
We will find out.

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:48.170
Leave. Just leave.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:50.580
Stop lingering in front of me. Go!

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:52.020
Get out!

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:04.070
Jianren.

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:06.000
Get the sharks

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:07.380
to stop moving!

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:08.060
Okay.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.010
Stop moving!

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.350
Stop moving!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.000
Mr. Rong, they...

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:19.270
Mr. Rong!

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:22.200
Mr. Rong!

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:23.680
They're sharks!

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:26.110
Where are the people?

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:26.880
Come here!

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:39.950
Mr. Rong.

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:41.340
Are you okay?

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:56.220
[Sanjiangkou People's Hospital]

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.440
[Orthopaedics Department] [Orthopaedics Section 1]

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.160
My leg got hurt.
What are you crying out for?

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:00.000
Well, you...

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:00.840
Here.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:01.480
Okay.

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:02.350
I'm fine.

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:03.280
I'm really fine.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:04.070
Have a seat.

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:06.510
[Orthopaedics Department] [Orthopaedics Section 1]

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.160
Please wait a moment.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:07.750
I'll go get the X-rays.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.280
Go ahead.

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:40.110
Hello.

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:41.280
Hello, Chief.

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:42.650
Li Feng has confessed to everything.

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:43.710
Confessed to what?

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:44.720
This Li Feng,

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:46.300
over the past three years,

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:48.440
has committed over a dozen robberies.

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:49.790
Among them, nine involved murder,

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:50.750
one attempted murder,

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.640
resulting in fifteen deaths in total.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.510
He started to hide in Sanjiangkou
half a year ago.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:55.440
How many deaths?

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:56.270
Fifteen.

00:19:57.610 --> 00:19:58.260
Chief.

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:00.360
He is a Class A wanted criminal.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.680
For three consecutive years,

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:02.480
the bureau has issued

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:04.030
a priority arrest warrant for him.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:04.640
Across five provinces,

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:07.070
tens of thousands of police officers
have been deployed to catch him.

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:07.680
Several times,

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.010
he was almost caught.

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:10.580
So close.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.720
But he managed to escape every time.

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:13.430
This time,

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:15.380
you finally caught him.

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:24.790
Chief?

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:27.010
Chief, are you listening?

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:27.920
[Orthopaedics Department] [Orthopaedics Section 1]

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.160
Are you sure it's him?

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:30.880
The fingerprints match.

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:31.880
There's no doubt.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.350
The interrogation is still ongoing.

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:35.000
Chief Qi and Captain Wang
are both keeping an eye on it.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:35.660
Good. Then,

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:37.310
thanks for your hard work.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:39.110
Keep interrogating him for now.

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:43.040
[Interrogation Room]

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:46.420
[Orthopedic Section 1]

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:48.690
That's quite an achievement.

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:50.480
This is a year ahead of schedule,

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:52.340
and I've overfulfilled the task.

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:56.680
Does this mean
I can go back to the provincial capital?

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:05.350
Chief.

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:08.840
Chief.

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:09.840
Why are you standing up?

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:10.350
Well.

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:11.440
I was just sitting here,

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:12.170
and suddenly

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:13.920
my whole leg cannot be felt.

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:14.520
It's numb.

00:21:15.780 --> 00:21:16.930
Is it that serious?

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:20.160
Look,

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:21.850
I really can't feel it.

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.780
You have to keep taking the medicine.

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.040
And you

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:32.810
should stay positive.

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.020
In your daily life,

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:35.920
watch more funny jokes,

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:38.180
cross-talks, sketches,

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:39.270
or comedy movies.

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:43.040
He's been watching them.

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:49.410
Your vital signs

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:51.080
are all quite stable.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:54.120
Do you feel uncomfortable anywhere else?

00:21:57.200 --> 00:21:57.810
It hurts.

00:21:58.400 --> 00:21:59.330
What did you say?

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:01.250
It hurts.

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:04.160
Speak louder.

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:05.590
My arm hurts!

00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:11.160
Arm.

00:22:14.590 --> 00:22:16.100
His arm hurts.

00:22:16.510 --> 00:22:17.040
How about

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:19.370
you take him to orthopedics downstairs?

00:22:19.590 --> 00:22:20.030
Okay.

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:24.880
Doctor,

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:26.380
is he okay?

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:29.090
His bones are fine.

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:30.400
I'll just prescribe some medicine for him.

00:22:30.400 --> 00:22:30.980
Okay.

00:22:33.440 --> 00:22:34.500
Then could there be

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.240
some neurological problem?

00:22:36.240 --> 00:22:37.880
Right now, not only
does my whole leg hurt,

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:38.740
it's also numb.

00:22:40.110 --> 00:22:41.440
How about I get one of those

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:42.400
full body checkups

00:22:42.400 --> 00:22:44.060
to examine my body carefully?

00:22:44.400 --> 00:22:46.070
Theoretically, it's not necessary.

00:22:46.070 --> 00:22:47.550
I don't think it's anything serious.

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:48.310
Don't you trust

00:22:48.310 --> 00:22:49.510
what the doctor says?

00:22:49.790 --> 00:22:51.030
She said theoretically.

00:22:51.030 --> 00:22:52.830
But my whole leg actually hurts.

00:22:53.240 --> 00:22:53.960
How about I go back to

00:22:53.960 --> 00:22:55.030
the provincial hospital for a checkup.

00:22:55.030 --> 00:22:56.210
After all, the medical facilities here...

00:22:56.210 --> 00:22:56.530
[Sanjiangkou People's Hospital Radiology Report]

00:22:56.720 --> 00:22:58.510
If you don't trust our hospital,

00:22:58.510 --> 00:22:59.910
you can go to another one.

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:03.900
Are you his family?

00:23:04.510 --> 00:23:05.220
How about

00:23:05.420 --> 00:23:07.110
you take him to the fourth floor?

00:23:07.110 --> 00:23:08.160
The psychiatry department

00:23:08.160 --> 00:23:10.020
might be able to cure his illness.

00:23:13.440 --> 00:23:16.540
[Psychiatry Department]

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:19.260
Mr. Rong, are you okay?

00:23:21.890 --> 00:23:23.420
Tell Bowen to come to see me.

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:25.670
No need.

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:27.880
We'll go find him.

00:23:29.640 --> 00:23:30.770
Bring your weapons.

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:33.720
Mr. Rong.

00:23:34.790 --> 00:23:36.250
Are you suspecting that Ye

00:23:36.860 --> 00:23:38.340
was killed by Bowen?

00:23:42.110 --> 00:23:43.640
Killing someone

00:23:43.720 --> 00:23:45.160
isn't easy for an ordinary person,

00:23:45.160 --> 00:23:46.690
let alone killing another.

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:50.520
On the birthday, I told Bowen

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:51.910
to clean up his mess,

00:23:52.270 --> 00:23:53.880
or Ye wouldn't show mercy.

00:23:55.070 --> 00:23:56.130
Then Ye was killed.

00:23:57.310 --> 00:23:57.920
Who else

00:23:57.940 --> 00:23:59.340
could I suspect for this?

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:01.280
If it really is him,

00:24:01.830 --> 00:24:03.630
I'll have to clean house myself.

00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:05.690
If he dares to hurt Ye,

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:08.220
he'll dare to hurt me sooner or later.

00:24:16.240 --> 00:24:16.410
[Psychiatry Department]

00:24:16.410 --> 00:24:17.920
Why are we on the fourth floor?

00:24:17.920 --> 00:24:18.590
Didn't the doctor ask you

00:24:18.590 --> 00:24:20.920
to come to the fourth floor
for a check-up?

00:24:27.070 --> 00:24:27.870
Xing, tell me,

00:24:28.570 --> 00:24:29.830
do I look like a psycho?

00:24:31.070 --> 00:24:31.680
Didn't you say

00:24:31.680 --> 00:24:33.070
you want a full checkup?

00:24:39.310 --> 00:24:40.760
Killing 15 people.

00:24:41.070 --> 00:24:43.530
How many times
would he be executed for that?

00:24:43.550 --> 00:24:45.010
Let's not talk about work.

00:24:46.160 --> 00:24:47.210
You have all kinds of experiences.

00:24:47.210 --> 00:24:49.140
I still have a lot to learn from you.

00:25:01.440 --> 00:25:02.030
Seriously, do people nowadays

00:25:02.030 --> 00:25:03.290
really brag that much?

00:25:03.510 --> 00:25:04.510
Just ignore them.

00:25:05.240 --> 00:25:06.720
They were going to the fourth floor.

00:25:06.720 --> 00:25:07.980
They might be psychos.

00:25:09.680 --> 00:25:11.810
I just came down from the fourth floor.

00:25:12.880 --> 00:25:13.410
Mr. Rong.

00:25:14.030 --> 00:25:16.000
I definitely wasn't talking about you.

00:25:16.000 --> 00:25:17.480
Then why come to orthopedics?

00:25:17.480 --> 00:25:18.590
Didn't the doctor just ask us to

00:25:18.590 --> 00:25:20.310
come to orthopedics on the second floor?

00:25:20.310 --> 00:25:21.260
Why come to orthopedics?

00:25:21.260 --> 00:25:21.790
[Orthopedics Department]

00:25:21.790 --> 00:25:23.000
Since we're here, let's have a check-up.

00:25:23.000 --> 00:25:23.350
No, no.

00:25:23.350 --> 00:25:23.660
Let's have a thorough check-up.

00:25:23.660 --> 00:25:24.200
[Orthopedics Section 2]

00:25:24.200 --> 00:25:24.930
No, I refuse.

00:25:28.920 --> 00:25:30.920
Even if one really killed 15 people,

00:25:32.310 --> 00:25:34.170
he can only be shot once if caught.

00:25:43.310 --> 00:25:43.900
Li Feng.

00:25:44.680 --> 00:25:46.810
Start confessing from the first case.

00:25:47.880 --> 00:25:48.880
Can I start confessing

00:25:48.880 --> 00:25:50.080
from the second case?

00:25:50.240 --> 00:25:51.640
Mind your attitude.

00:25:52.930 --> 00:25:54.620
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau Personal Information Form]

00:25:55.110 --> 00:25:56.150
You and Li Feng

00:25:56.180 --> 00:25:57.710
grew up in the same village.

00:25:57.960 --> 00:25:59.480
You are one year younger than him,

00:25:59.480 --> 00:26:01.210
so you were childhood friends.

00:26:01.640 --> 00:26:02.810
When you were 16,

00:26:03.030 --> 00:26:05.830
you were raped by your uncle
from the same village.

00:26:06.030 --> 00:26:07.830
He was a villain in your village.

00:26:08.310 --> 00:26:10.310
Your parents were threatened by him

00:26:10.400 --> 00:26:11.930
and didn't dare to speak up.

00:26:12.270 --> 00:26:13.330
After Li Feng found out,

00:26:13.330 --> 00:26:15.190
he went to him to settle the score.

00:26:15.480 --> 00:26:16.480
During the fight,

00:26:17.190 --> 00:26:18.790
he accidentally killed him.

00:26:19.750 --> 00:26:21.880
He was sentenced to 12 years in prison.

00:26:22.070 --> 00:26:22.920
This is the

00:26:22.920 --> 00:26:24.380
first crime he committed.

00:26:25.200 --> 00:26:26.070
I killed people

00:26:27.480 --> 00:26:28.680
because fate was

00:26:28.680 --> 00:26:29.880
too unfair to my wife.

00:26:30.160 --> 00:26:31.360
After I was released,

00:26:31.750 --> 00:26:34.410
I found out
she was forced to marry someone else.

00:26:34.510 --> 00:26:35.080
That jerk didn't love her at all.

00:26:35.080 --> 00:26:37.170
♪ The moon is hanging far away in the night ♪

00:26:37.170 --> 00:26:39.100
After finding out she was raped,

00:26:39.310 --> 00:26:40.840
not only did he not help her,

00:26:40.960 --> 00:26:43.400
but he also beat her constantly.

00:26:43.830 --> 00:26:44.230
He forced her to do that

00:26:44.230 --> 00:26:45.880
♪ Lighting up the pedestrians' faces ♪

00:26:45.880 --> 00:26:46.960
to support him.

00:26:48.350 --> 00:26:50.720
In a fit of rage, I killed his whole family.

00:26:50.760 --> 00:26:52.090
They were all scumbags.

00:26:52.740 --> 00:26:53.700
♪ Why are you standing in the center of the city? ♪

00:26:53.700 --> 00:26:55.200
Then I let her elope with me.

00:26:55.200 --> 00:26:57.110
Li Feng constantly committed robberies

00:26:57.110 --> 00:26:57.950
and thefts

00:26:58.070 --> 00:26:59.030
to make a living.

00:26:59.920 --> 00:27:00.090
During the time, he killed

00:27:00.090 --> 00:27:00.880
♪ But I couldn't find my way home ♪

00:27:00.880 --> 00:27:02.410
multiple innocent people.

00:27:05.110 --> 00:27:06.270
Besides these 15 lives,

00:27:06.270 --> 00:27:07.470
are there any others?

00:27:15.550 --> 00:27:16.030
No.

00:27:16.830 --> 00:27:18.440
Let me ask you another question.

00:27:18.440 --> 00:27:18.920
Li Feng,

00:27:19.030 --> 00:27:20.890
you were doing fine in Jiangsu,

00:27:20.960 --> 00:27:22.400
and the police didn't track you down.

00:27:22.400 --> 00:27:23.960
Why did you come to Sanjiangkou?

00:27:23.960 --> 00:27:25.160
To hide from you guys.

00:27:27.830 --> 00:27:28.420
Half a year ago,

00:27:28.420 --> 00:27:29.750
we came to Sanjiangkou.

00:27:31.110 --> 00:27:33.040
Then we didn't want to run anymore,

00:27:34.200 --> 00:27:36.310
so we took over a small shop
and settled down.

00:27:36.310 --> 00:27:37.440
One day, on the street,

00:27:37.440 --> 00:27:38.900
I ran into an old cellmate.

00:27:39.750 --> 00:27:41.240
He said someone hired him to kill a person.

00:27:41.240 --> 00:27:43.000
The remuneration was 200,000 yuan.

00:27:43.000 --> 00:27:44.440
He wanted my help and promised

00:27:44.440 --> 00:27:45.830
to give me half of the money.

00:27:45.830 --> 00:27:46.550
So I agreed.

00:27:48.640 --> 00:27:49.840
I only found out later

00:27:50.030 --> 00:27:51.270
that the target

00:27:52.350 --> 00:27:53.440
was an old cop.

00:27:53.920 --> 00:27:54.680
A cop?

00:27:54.750 --> 00:27:56.830
Seemed like he was a superior official.

00:27:56.830 --> 00:27:57.880
What was his name?

00:27:59.200 --> 00:28:00.200
I don't remember.

00:28:01.640 --> 00:28:02.350
I think...

00:28:04.240 --> 00:28:05.770
I think his last name was Lu.

00:28:08.240 --> 00:28:08.790
Chief Qi.

00:28:10.590 --> 00:28:11.990
Keep interrogating him.

00:28:13.590 --> 00:28:14.030
Show him the photo.

00:28:14.030 --> 00:28:14.360
Okay.

00:28:15.160 --> 00:28:16.000
Because of my leg injury,

00:28:16.000 --> 00:28:16.960
I might need to go back to...

00:28:16.960 --> 00:28:17.910
Sit down first, Yi'ang.

00:28:17.910 --> 00:28:18.460
Sit.

00:28:20.000 --> 00:28:20.800
What's wrong?

00:28:29.750 --> 00:28:30.680
Is he the target?

00:28:38.110 --> 00:28:38.550
Yes.

00:28:40.680 --> 00:28:41.240
And then?

00:28:42.680 --> 00:28:43.450
Did you do it?

00:28:43.680 --> 00:28:44.110
No.

00:28:44.960 --> 00:28:46.020
I wanted to at first

00:28:46.640 --> 00:28:47.590
because my child is too young,

00:28:47.590 --> 00:28:49.270
and I would need
a lot of money in the future.

00:28:49.270 --> 00:28:50.930
I thought if I did this one job,

00:28:51.350 --> 00:28:52.590
even if I got caught,

00:28:52.720 --> 00:28:54.780
it'd be good to leave them some money.

00:28:55.750 --> 00:28:57.610
Later, my wife talked me out of it.

00:28:58.030 --> 00:28:58.760
Afterwards,

00:28:59.640 --> 00:29:00.480
I went soft.

00:29:01.440 --> 00:29:02.160
My cellmate

00:29:02.160 --> 00:29:04.020
never contacted me again either.

00:29:05.590 --> 00:29:07.130
Was this cop named Lu

00:29:07.250 --> 00:29:08.320
killed later?

00:29:09.790 --> 00:29:11.590
I wasn't involved. I don't know.

00:29:11.830 --> 00:29:12.590
But I guess

00:29:12.590 --> 00:29:13.990
my cellmate didn't do it.

00:29:14.400 --> 00:29:15.730
He didn't have the guts.

00:29:16.920 --> 00:29:18.580
What's your cellmate's name?

00:29:21.510 --> 00:29:22.200
If you don't know his name,

00:29:22.200 --> 00:29:23.530
how about his nickname?

00:29:23.550 --> 00:29:25.410
Where did he live in Sanjiangkou?

00:29:27.110 --> 00:29:27.920
Sir,

00:29:29.160 --> 00:29:30.400
is the answer to this question

00:29:30.400 --> 00:29:31.770
important to you?

00:29:33.720 --> 00:29:34.350
Li Feng.

00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:36.240
Look at me.

00:29:37.750 --> 00:29:38.830
I'm asking you one last time.

00:29:38.830 --> 00:29:39.830
Speak properly.

00:29:42.640 --> 00:29:44.300
What's your cellmate's name?

00:29:44.810 --> 00:29:46.130
Who hired him?

00:29:48.970 --> 00:29:50.020
I can tell you,

00:29:51.110 --> 00:29:52.240
but I have a request.

00:29:53.310 --> 00:29:54.300
I want to see

00:29:54.400 --> 00:29:55.510
my wife and child.

00:29:59.110 --> 00:30:00.840
Someone wants to harm Chief Lu?

00:30:04.200 --> 00:30:05.260
Grant his request.

00:30:06.830 --> 00:30:07.410
Yi'ang.

00:30:07.830 --> 00:30:08.900
That's against the rules.

00:30:08.900 --> 00:30:09.960
What if they collude
to falsify statements?

00:30:09.960 --> 00:30:12.420
I'll take responsibility for any problems.

00:30:39.880 --> 00:30:40.440
Mr. Rong.

00:30:41.030 --> 00:30:42.070
What's so urgent

00:30:42.070 --> 00:30:43.830
that we can't talk about it on the phone?

00:30:43.830 --> 00:30:44.440
In the middle of the night,

00:30:44.440 --> 00:30:45.770
you came here in person.

00:30:49.400 --> 00:30:50.860
I'll go get you some water.

00:30:50.960 --> 00:30:51.890
Ren, have a seat.

00:30:52.110 --> 00:30:52.710
Yangyang.

00:30:54.110 --> 00:30:55.440
Go back to your room.

00:30:59.480 --> 00:31:00.960
Just do as Mr. Rong says.

00:31:16.000 --> 00:31:17.400
What happened, Mr. Rong?

00:31:18.240 --> 00:31:18.880
Ye

00:31:20.400 --> 00:31:21.030
is dead.

00:31:22.920 --> 00:31:23.310
Who?

00:31:25.680 --> 00:31:26.310
Ye Jian.

00:31:27.590 --> 00:31:28.250
Captain Ye.

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:30.900
Dead?

00:31:31.440 --> 00:31:32.250
How did he die?

00:31:38.200 --> 00:31:39.170
You tell me

00:31:39.790 --> 00:31:40.880
how he died.

00:31:41.550 --> 00:31:42.450
Asking me?

00:31:43.640 --> 00:31:44.000
I...

00:31:44.110 --> 00:31:44.640
Bowen.

00:31:46.400 --> 00:31:47.600
Mr. Rong wants to know

00:31:48.000 --> 00:31:49.730
what you were doing last night.

00:31:57.030 --> 00:31:58.200
I was at home.

00:31:59.160 --> 00:32:00.420
Yangyang can prove it.

00:32:02.800 --> 00:32:03.370
Mr. Rong,

00:32:03.400 --> 00:32:04.750
you think I did it?

00:32:05.000 --> 00:32:05.830
He's a cop.

00:32:06.110 --> 00:32:07.720
Who in Sanjiangkou would dare to harm him?

00:32:07.720 --> 00:32:09.400
Who is the most experienced at this?

00:32:09.400 --> 00:32:10.750
Mr. Rong, I swear to God.

00:32:11.640 --> 00:32:12.960
-If I did it...
-If swearing works,

00:32:12.960 --> 00:32:14.560
why would we need the police?

00:32:14.680 --> 00:32:15.720
If I did it, kill me right now.

00:32:15.720 --> 00:32:16.070
Okay?

00:32:16.070 --> 00:32:16.750
You think I'm not

00:32:16.750 --> 00:32:17.730
going to do it?

00:32:24.590 --> 00:32:25.350
Don't move.

00:32:42.400 --> 00:32:43.310
Be careful.

00:32:44.720 --> 00:32:46.060
Don't let it misfire.

00:32:48.160 --> 00:32:48.840
Move away.

00:32:53.310 --> 00:32:54.480
You move away.

00:33:01.880 --> 00:33:02.880
Get out of the way.

00:33:03.640 --> 00:33:04.310
Mr. Rong.

00:33:05.400 --> 00:33:07.000
If you really don't trust me,

00:33:08.030 --> 00:33:09.360
then shoot me right now.

00:33:33.590 --> 00:33:34.450
Don't blame me.

00:33:35.680 --> 00:33:36.420
You know,

00:33:38.830 --> 00:33:39.510
I'm sick.

00:33:43.350 --> 00:33:43.880
Mr. Rong.

00:33:45.830 --> 00:33:48.420
Ye Jian was my bro too.

00:33:50.680 --> 00:33:53.570
How could I do something like that?

00:33:58.550 --> 00:33:59.110
Mr. Rong.

00:34:00.680 --> 00:34:02.740
This whole thing is getting weirder.

00:34:03.440 --> 00:34:04.880
That Chief Zhang

00:34:05.200 --> 00:34:06.750
came and took Ye's position.

00:34:06.750 --> 00:34:08.150
When he arrived, Ye died.

00:34:08.710 --> 00:34:09.330
So,

00:34:09.670 --> 00:34:10.730
who in Sanjiangkou

00:34:10.800 --> 00:34:12.460
has the capability to do that?

00:34:14.320 --> 00:34:15.760
Tell me the truth.

00:34:16.920 --> 00:34:18.070
How did you handle

00:34:19.320 --> 00:34:20.780
that thing half a year ago?

00:34:21.440 --> 00:34:22.010
Mr. Rong.

00:34:22.230 --> 00:34:23.880
Nothing will go wrong with that.

00:34:23.880 --> 00:34:25.540
I need to know all the details.

00:34:26.400 --> 00:34:28.199
I can't let anyone else get hurt.

00:34:29.480 --> 00:34:31.280
Half a year ago, I put the word out

00:34:31.400 --> 00:34:32.360
and hired a hitman

00:34:32.360 --> 00:34:33.080
called Fei.

00:34:33.760 --> 00:34:35.620
But he didn't dare to take the job.

00:34:36.000 --> 00:34:37.320
Does this Fei

00:34:37.550 --> 00:34:38.350
know about me?

00:34:40.360 --> 00:34:40.880
No.

00:34:44.440 --> 00:34:46.040
Do you have his contact info?

00:34:47.080 --> 00:34:48.610
I'll contact him right now.

00:34:49.670 --> 00:34:51.469
You don't need to worry about it.

00:34:51.880 --> 00:34:53.800
Give the address to Jianren.

00:34:54.800 --> 00:34:55.800
He will handle it.

00:35:03.550 --> 00:35:05.150
Mr. Rong, Ren, are you leaving now?

00:35:05.150 --> 00:35:06.070
Study hard.

00:35:06.230 --> 00:35:06.920
Rongcheng Group

00:35:06.920 --> 00:35:09.000
always has positions for young people.

00:35:09.000 --> 00:35:09.330
Come.

00:35:09.360 --> 00:35:10.280
Let me see you out.

00:35:10.280 --> 00:35:10.800
No need.

00:35:10.920 --> 00:35:11.780
We know the way.

00:35:14.510 --> 00:35:15.720
Take care, Mr. Rong.

00:35:22.620 --> 00:35:24.020
Why aren't you sleeping?

00:35:24.400 --> 00:35:24.980
Brother,

00:35:25.030 --> 00:35:25.820
between you and Mr. Rong,

00:35:25.820 --> 00:35:27.420
there's no bad blood, right?

00:35:27.800 --> 00:35:29.070
Don't go anywhere for now.

00:35:29.070 --> 00:35:30.270
Especially at night.

00:35:30.320 --> 00:35:31.530
Just stay at home.

00:35:32.230 --> 00:35:33.360
If you really have to go somewhere,

00:35:33.360 --> 00:35:34.490
you must let me know.

00:35:37.360 --> 00:35:38.240
Do you hear me?

00:35:38.590 --> 00:35:39.450
What happened?

00:35:40.190 --> 00:35:40.800
Whatever happened

00:35:40.800 --> 00:35:42.150
has nothing to do with you.

00:35:42.150 --> 00:35:43.680
Just remember what I said.

00:35:43.880 --> 00:35:45.630
How does it have nothing to do with me?

00:35:45.630 --> 00:35:45.690
You are my brother.

00:35:45.690 --> 00:35:46.480
[Lang Botu, Lang Bowen's younger brother]

00:35:46.480 --> 00:35:48.140
Your business is my business.

00:35:54.400 --> 00:35:55.520
Little kid.

00:35:56.030 --> 00:35:57.110
You think you've grown up

00:35:57.110 --> 00:35:59.040
and want to shoulder things for me?

00:35:59.190 --> 00:35:59.960
Wait until you

00:35:59.960 --> 00:36:00.760
don't have to do homework.

00:36:00.760 --> 00:36:01.630
Then we'll talk.

00:36:01.630 --> 00:36:02.830
I'm not a kid anymore.

00:36:05.840 --> 00:36:06.920
Your task right now

00:36:06.920 --> 00:36:07.840
is to study hard

00:36:07.840 --> 00:36:08.840
and study abroad.

00:36:10.550 --> 00:36:12.550
Don't get involved in our business.

00:36:35.280 --> 00:36:36.280
Sir, stop asking.

00:36:36.560 --> 00:36:37.480
If you don't grant my request,

00:36:37.480 --> 00:36:38.680
I won't say anything.

00:36:42.030 --> 00:36:42.690
I won't ask.

00:36:48.840 --> 00:36:49.800
Li Feng.

00:36:51.070 --> 00:36:51.590
Baby,

00:36:52.000 --> 00:36:52.440
look.

00:36:52.840 --> 00:36:53.640
That's Daddy.

00:36:56.670 --> 00:36:58.840
I have thought of a name for the child.

00:37:01.550 --> 00:37:03.010
He'll be named Li Feng too.

00:37:05.970 --> 00:37:08.130
I will bring him up

00:37:08.670 --> 00:37:10.150
stay with him all my life,

00:37:11.620 --> 00:37:13.780
and teach him to be a good person.

00:37:41.280 --> 00:37:42.340
Let's hit the road.

00:37:48.070 --> 00:37:48.920
Sir.

00:37:51.400 --> 00:37:52.890
My cellmate is called Fei,

00:37:53.510 --> 00:37:54.710
nicknamed Scarface.

00:38:08.480 --> 00:38:09.360
Ren.

00:38:10.550 --> 00:38:12.030
Let me go, Ren.

00:38:14.480 --> 00:38:15.150
Fei.

00:38:16.230 --> 00:38:17.840
Let me ask you a few questions.

00:38:17.840 --> 00:38:18.800
Tell the truth,

00:38:19.230 --> 00:38:20.290
and you'll be fine.

00:38:21.960 --> 00:38:22.550
Really?

00:38:23.400 --> 00:38:24.230
Okay.

00:38:24.710 --> 00:38:25.610
Does anyone else know

00:38:25.610 --> 00:38:27.400
that I hired you to kill that person?

00:38:27.400 --> 00:38:28.600
I didn't kill anyone.

00:38:35.710 --> 00:38:36.460
Bro.

00:38:44.010 --> 00:38:45.340
Listen to the question.

00:38:46.630 --> 00:38:47.690
Listen carefully.

00:38:47.710 --> 00:38:48.880
I remember it now.

00:38:48.960 --> 00:38:50.020
I remember it now.

00:38:50.140 --> 00:38:50.940
I remember it.

00:38:51.480 --> 00:38:52.920
Back then, I didn't dare to...

00:38:52.920 --> 00:38:54.700
I didn't dare to do it myself.

00:38:55.070 --> 00:38:55.560
So I...

00:38:55.630 --> 00:38:56.920
I found a cellmate of mine,

00:38:56.920 --> 00:38:57.720
named Li Feng.

00:38:59.840 --> 00:39:01.300
Before doing it, we agreed

00:39:01.300 --> 00:39:02.280
to meet at 7 p.m.

00:39:02.280 --> 00:39:03.190
at an intersection.

00:39:03.190 --> 00:39:03.960
But he didn't show up.

00:39:03.960 --> 00:39:05.070
I really didn't kill anyone.

00:39:05.070 --> 00:39:06.150
I really didn't.

00:39:07.480 --> 00:39:08.480
I didn't.

00:39:13.190 --> 00:39:14.120
Where is Li Feng?

00:39:16.550 --> 00:39:16.920
I...

00:39:17.960 --> 00:39:18.690
I don't know.

00:39:19.070 --> 00:39:20.470
I really don't know, Bro.

00:39:20.480 --> 00:39:21.760
I didn't trust him,

00:39:21.760 --> 00:39:23.230
so I didn't leave him

00:39:23.230 --> 00:39:24.320
my phone number.

00:39:25.280 --> 00:39:26.810
You had no his contact info.

00:39:27.360 --> 00:39:28.760
How did you contact him?

00:39:28.780 --> 00:39:29.440
Through QQ.

00:39:29.760 --> 00:39:31.230
I have his QQ number.

00:39:31.320 --> 00:39:32.150
Koukou?

00:39:32.320 --> 00:39:33.720
I have a computer at home.

00:39:33.920 --> 00:39:34.400
QQ.

00:39:34.440 --> 00:39:34.960
Yes.

00:39:34.960 --> 00:39:36.830
I have a computer at home.

00:39:37.480 --> 00:39:38.000
Typing.

00:39:39.440 --> 00:39:40.550
Get up quickly.

00:39:40.670 --> 00:39:41.560
Get up.

00:39:44.410 --> 00:39:45.870
It's a misunderstanding.

00:39:46.440 --> 00:39:47.050
Thanks for your hard work.

00:39:47.050 --> 00:39:47.840
It's fine.

00:39:51.320 --> 00:39:51.920
Sorry.

00:39:54.800 --> 00:39:55.480
Ren.

00:39:56.360 --> 00:39:57.230
Ren.

00:40:10.400 --> 00:40:11.600
Bury his mouth first.

00:40:11.730 --> 00:40:12.230
Okay.

00:40:12.230 --> 00:40:12.880
Okay, Bro.

00:40:13.550 --> 00:40:14.880
Why is he still cursing?

00:40:19.800 --> 00:40:20.280
Hello.

00:40:21.360 --> 00:40:22.030
Li Penggai,

00:40:23.480 --> 00:40:24.880
I need you
to take care of something.